OL,2,V55555555CFORMER E GERMAN
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CLEADER TO FACE TRIAL
OL,5, East Germany's disgraced former leader
OL,6, Erich Honecker and three other top
OL,7, officials are to be put on trial for
OL,8, treason in March.
OL,10, Prosecutor-General Hans-Juergen Joseph
OL,11, made the announcement in parliament
OL,12, after Mr Honecker was arrested as he
OL,13, left hospital and taken to prison.
OL,15, Mr Honecker, 77, had undergone an
OL,16, operation for cancer and doctors said
OL,17, he was not well enough to be arrested.
OL,19, The other three are ex-police chief
OL,20, Erich Mielke, economics chief Guenter
OL,21, Mittag and media boss Joachim Herrmann.
OL,22,G]D This ORACLE page is from 29-01-90
OL,23,G] AMuch more at: teletextarchive.com
