OL,2,V55555555CUSA TO CLOSE THREE
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CBRITISH AIR BASES
OL,5, The US administration has proposed the
OL,6, closure of three bases in England as
OL,7, part of a programme of defence cuts.
OL,9, About 300 British jobs are expected to
OL,10, go as a result of the closures.
OL,12, Defence Secretary Dick Cheney has
OL,13, proposed to close a total of 60 bases
OL,14, in the United States and some ten
OL,15, installations elsewhere.
OL,17, His list includes bases at Fairford,
OL,18, Gloucestershire; Wethersfield, Essex;
OL,19, and Greenham Common in Berkshire.
OL,21, Congress will have to approve the plan
OL,22,G]D This ORACLE page is from 29-01-90
OL,23,G] AMuch more at: teletextarchive.com
