OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                         G6/13
OL,2,V55555555CALEXANDRA: NURSE
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CREMANDED IN CUSTODY
OL,5, Nurse Janet Griffiths has been remanded
OL,6, in custody until February 12, charged
OL,7, with the abduction of baby Alexandra
OL,8, Griffiths.
OL,10, Griffiths, 33, said nothing during the
OL,11, three-minute hearing at Horseferry Road
OL,12, Magistrates' Court in London except to
OL,13, answer to her name and address.
OL,15, Her lawyer's request for a medical and
OL,16, psychiatric report was granted.
OL,18, The prosecution asked for a charge
OL,19, under the Offences Against a Person Act
OL,20, of 1861 to be withdrawn because the
OL,21, offence had been repealed.
OL,22,G]D This ORACLE page is from 29-01-90
OL,23,G] AMuch more at: teletextarchive.com
